        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Peach_Orchard%2C_Arkansas",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The town's economy once centered on timber harvesting, then cotton ginning, and even button blanks made from Black River mussels.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        1
